/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/core.k-76-  syntax Bool ::= isCellRef(Val) [function, total]
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/core.k-77-  rule isCellRef(cellRef(_:Int)) => true
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/core.k-78-  rule isCellRef(_:Val)          => false [owise]
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/core.k-79-  // k-top deref for cell-bound reads surfacing INSIDE the annotated frame
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:80:  // (AugAssign's in-place read and friends). The "$cells" guard keeps this
/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/core.k-81-  // DECIDABLY inapplicable in plain frames — an unguarded rule lets the
