codex
I found the exact infrastructure fault: this sandbox’s process sees a numeric PID from `getpid()` that is absent from its mounted `/proc`, while Lean 4.22 resolves its executable via `/proc/<getpid>/exe` instead of `/proc/self/exe`. I’m applying a narrow, auditable compatibility shim that changes only that `readlink` path; it does not touch the generated project or affect theorem content. Then I’ll rerun the unmodified trusted checker.
