The substantive review is complete: the summaries match the frozen loop step by structural recursion, the branch partition is exhaustive and precedence-sensitive, and counterfactual constant/identity/overlap mutations are detected. No inventory rule is a mathematical domain lemma, so the empty Stage 4 obligation set is legitimate. I’m writing the self-contained review and then doing a final artifact/verdict consistency check.
