+- `evidence/source-semantics-excerpts.txt`: frozen source, spec, and supplied
+  semantics excerpts with commands.
+- `evidence/target-and-stage5-check.txt`: absent target and absent candidate.
+
+VERDICT: PASS
+LEGITIMACY: LEGIT
