+rg -n 'targetStatement' /reference/klean-generation/generated --glob '*.lean'
+test -e /candidate
+python3 -m json.tool /reference/klean-generation/generated/obligation-map.json
+```
+
+Exact exit codes and result: `target-and-stage5-check.txt`.
